usage: python -m tools.cli [-h] [--worktree-admission {create,resume}]
                           [--branch BRANCH] [--path PATH]
                           [--surface {datasets-unpd,frontend-sentry-build,frontend-sentry-runtime,llm-anthropic,llm-openai,runtime-oidc,runtime-research-postgres,runtime-signing}]
                           [--list-surfaces] [--skip-playwright]
                           [--skip-lockfile-checks] [--skip-contract-checks]

Validate local prerequisites for policy-engine.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --worktree-admission {create,resume}
                        Read-only admission of an exact branch/path pair; emit
                        a JSON receipt and exit.
  --branch BRANCH       Exact short branch name; no ref expressions or
                        substitutes.
  --path PATH           Exact absolute worktree root, not its product
                        subdirectory.
  --surface {datasets-unpd,frontend-sentry-build,frontend-sentry-runtime,llm-anthropic,llm-openai,runtime-oidc,runtime-research-postgres,runtime-signing}
                        Optional env surface to validate (repeatable).
  --list-surfaces       Print known optional surfaces and exit.
  --skip-playwright     Skip the Playwright browser smoke-check.
  --skip-lockfile-checks
                        Skip uv.lock and package-lock freshness checks.
  --skip-contract-checks
                        Skip generated-contract freshness checks.
